    54	One incidence correction is needed.  At a self-double point of $D$, the B0
    55	shorthand $a_z=1$ assumes that no trivial-owner component also passes through
    56	$z$.  In P3a one $W=1$ component may pass through it, in which case $a_z=0$
    57	and its trivial boundary cluster supplies the fixed letter; two such components
    58	cannot pass there.  In P3b its $W=2$ companion cannot pass through a two-branch
    59	point of $D$.  This follows directly from LOC at `B0:362-372` and is the S2
    60	version of REV's binding incidence repair at `REV:93-95`.  It does not change the
    61	local $S_5$ constraint in §2.
    62	
    63	Let $d=\deg \bar D$, let $r_1$ be the number of nodes, and put
    64	$T:=\sum_{k_z\geq2}k_z$.  Let $M_\infty$ denote the promoted embedded
    65	resolution quantity $\operatorname{mult}_{P_\infty}\bar D+\beta_h-1$ at the
    66	infinity branch.  The exact genus budget is
    67	
    68	\[
    69	  \delta_{\rm aff}=\sum_{z\in\operatorname{Sing}D} k_z=r_1+T,\qquad
    70	  \delta_\infty+\delta_{\rm aff}=\frac{(d-1)(d-2)}2.                 \tag{1.1}
