   291	local braid conjugate to $\sigma^{2k_z}$.  Hence the infinity braid
   292	$\beta_\infty\in B_d$ has
   293	
   294	\[
   295	 \operatorname{perm}(\beta_\infty)=\text{a }d\text{-cycle},\qquad
   296	 e(\beta_\infty)=d-1+2\delta_{\rm aff}.                            \tag{4.1}
