   571	Without ROW-PIN there is no S2 infinity type on which to run a full cable braid,
   572	no licensed fold relation, and no value of $\rho(\gamma_\infty)$ to feed the
   573	projective-cover route.  Once a row is pinned, the next decision is explicit:
