   398	claimed. Strictly narrower than B0's DQ-1 (`B0:615-620`) by the
   399	removal of `g=1`. Not a single numerical row.
   400	
   401	Exclusions:
   402	- Coprime: `g≥2` plus the Aut-to-coprime clause. Any curve that is
   403	  coprime in some affine normal form dies by §2; the Aut clause
   404	  catches coordinate changes that produce `(C1)`.
