   422	
   423	### 5.2 Row-pin OPEN
   424	
   425	**Verdict: CONFIRMED as the first missing geometric tool.**
   426	
   427	`OPEN[N5-S2-ROW-PIN]` (`SOL:563-568`) asks, in degree-minimal target
   428	coordinates, for either an exact degree/delta-sequence list for `D`
   429	(approximate-root remainders and the infinity multiplicity sequence)
