+For (d=9), the survivor threshold is (25):
+
+| delta row | nodal (T=0) | candidate tangential (T) | gate-killed (T) |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `(9,6,2)` | candidate | (2\ldots4) | none |
+| `(9,6,4)` | candidate, equality | (2\ldots6) | none |
+| `(9,6,5)` | KILLED | (2\ldots7) | (0) |
+| `(9,6,7)` | KILLED | (2\ldots9) | (0) |
+| `(9,6,8)` | KILLED | (2\ldots10) | (0) |
+| `(9,6,10)` | KILLED | (3\ldots12) | (0,2) |
