+|---|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| `(6,4,3)` | 7 | 3 | 16 | KILLED for every (T) |
+| `(6,4,5)` | 6 | 4 | 14 | KILLED for every (T) |
+| `(6,4,7)` | 5 | 5 | 12 | KILLED for every (T) |
