+\[
+ a\in\{3,7,9,11,13,15,17,19,21,23\},
+\]
+
+and (2.4)--(2.5) give
+(delta_{\rm aff}=(a+11)/2),
+(delta_\infty=(31-a)/2), (M_\infty=33-a):
+
