+## 5. Final residual ledger
+
+This ledger is necessary-only and applies identically to P3a and P3b, whose
+extra component meridians are trivial (`K:541-559`).  “Candidate” means only
+that every consumed numerical gate has been passed.
+
+| class | full numerical data | decision |
+|---|---|---|
