+| (Delta=(8,6,a)), (a\in A_8:=\{3,7,9,11,13,15,17,19,21,23\}) | (delta_\infty=(31-a)/2), (delta_{\rm aff}=(a+11)/2), (M_\infty=33-a), (r_1=delta_{\rm aff}-T) | candidate exactly when (T\in\{0\}\cup[2,delta_{\rm aff}]) and (2T\ge a-11); otherwise KILLED |
