+## 4. Gate-by-gate row decisions
+
+For every row below the promoted smooth-double shape gives
+
+\[
+ T\in\{0\}\cup\{2,3,\ldots,\delta_{\rm aff}\},\qquad
+ r_1=\delta_{\rm aff}-T.                                           \tag{4.1}
+\]
