+| every degree-minimal noncoprime row with $d\ge10$ not routed to a killed stratum | delta tower, $\delta_\infty,\delta_{\rm aff},M_\infty,T$ uncomputed | `OPEN[N5-S2-ROW-PIN-d>=10]` |
