+# N5-S2-ROW-PIN: geometric pin for the S2 cage
+
+## 1. Frozen inputs and promotion boundary
+
+The three mandated SHA-256 values were checked before any source was read and
+matched exactly:
+
+```text
+363cdd1ce1253b0a7429b231e2151477e3eaaad794710b98b73a9f530537f6d5  n5-s2-kill-chain-sol56-20260901.md
